 p9s │ ctx kind-demo │ ns all │ alpha v1.2.0 · beta 0.9.1 │ last audit 30s ago (alpha)                               RO
─ Help ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   :impact <policy>  what enforcing a policy would block (i on a policy row)
   :mut [engine]     mutations across engines
   :health           engine health: webhooks, controllers, audits, policies
   :ns [name|all]    scope every view to a namespace
   :ctx              kubeconfig contexts

 Keys
   d           describe
   y           YAML (Secret values are redacted)
   e           open the YAML in $VISUAL or $EDITOR (changes are discarded)
   g           go to the source object
   c           copy kind/namespace/name of the row's object
   C           copy a kubectl get command for it
   N V A S     sort by name, count, age, severity (again to reverse)
   o           :v grouped by owner ↔ flat list
   [ ]         :v current tab (audit results) ↔ recent tab (admission events)
   i           enforcement impact of the policy on this row

 Engine views (also reached by drilling down)
   :al/rules         fake engine rules
   :bt/rules         fake engine rules
 connected to kind-demo
